<title>UK: British Airways shares off on strike vote.</title>
<headline>British Airways shares off on strike vote.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in British Airways Plc fell on Wednesday, after the Transport and General Workers Union said cabin crew employed by the company were believed to have voted overwhemingly for industrial action.</p>
<p>The shares fell 7p to 693-1/2p shortly after the news.</p>
